Package: zplexpress
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0), cups, cups-client, xdg-utils
Suggests: ocom-ocbp-t4201-driver (>= 1.1.0)
Maintainer: Louis Nyirongo <louisnyirongo@lukeinternational.no>
Homepage: https://github.com/malawi-ministry-of-health-dhd/zplexpress
Description: ZPL/EPL-aware service for ARGOX, ZEBRA, and OCOM printers
 A Node.js service that detects ZPL and EPL commands received over HTTP and
 prints through CUPS. ARGOX and ZEBRA receive raw commands. OCOM receives the
 original commands through language-specific CUPS MIME types so the installed
 OCOM driver can render an exact-size PDF and produce printer-native TSPL.
